{
  "$comment": "VAPP-85: the `Box` style whitelist, verbatim from the VAPP-4 spike (`vapp_spike::WHITELIST` + the logical inline properties the spike added) — ONE source for the TS keys (`src/style.ts`), the JSON Schema (`core.schema.json#/$defs/style`) and the Swift/Kotlin/Rust key lists. Numbers are px (≡ pt ≡ dp); `length` also takes `\"N%\"`, `\"Npx\"` and `\"auto\"`; every value may be a token reference `$<group>.<name>` from tokens.json (colours: `#rrggbb[aa]` or `$color.<name>`). `borderWidth` is the ONE visual key with layout effect (a number or `$border.<name>`, VAPP-92); `fontFamily` (VAPP-92) takes only `$type.family.<name>`. Conditions nest one level: `\"@media (min-width: Npx)\"` resolves against the SURFACE width on the client, `\":pressed\"` against its own press state. Not in v1 (confirmed by the spike): transitions, transforms, calc(), named grid lines, gridAutoFlow, justifyItems, order, zIndex (paint order = tree order, absolute nodes LAST among siblings), multi-value shorthands.",
  "layout": {
    "display": { "enum": ["flex", "grid", "block", "none"] },
    "flexDirection": { "enum": ["row", "column", "row-reverse", "column-reverse"] },
    "flexWrap": { "enum": ["nowrap", "wrap", "wrap-reverse"] },
    "justifyContent": { "enum": ["flex-start", "flex-end", "start", "end", "center", "stretch", "space-between", "space-around", "space-evenly"] },
    "alignItems": { "enum": ["flex-start", "flex-end", "start", "end", "center", "stretch", "baseline"] },
    "alignContent": { "enum": ["flex-start", "flex-end", "start", "end", "center", "stretch", "space-between", "space-around", "space-evenly"] },
    "alignSelf": { "enum": ["flex-start", "flex-end", "start", "end", "center", "stretch", "baseline"] },
    "justifySelf": { "enum": ["flex-start", "flex-end", "start", "end", "center", "stretch", "baseline"] },
    "flexGrow": { "type": "number" },
    "flexShrink": { "type": "number" },
